[PrintTextModified Text:よろよろと立ち上がる。<br>瞳の端に浮かんだ涙を拭う。|#0205Adv08_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（でも……）|#0205Adv08_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（それでもボクは……！）|#0205Adv08_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

